```astro
---
import Layout from '~/layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'AstroWindy — SEO Content Writing';
const description =
  'Strategic, search-friendly articles written around real audiences, meaningful topics and the intent behind every query.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>

  <div class="topbar">
    <div class="container">
      <span>SEO content, written for humans and search engines.</span>
      <span>Free consultation →</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <header>
    <div class="container nav">
      <a class="brand" href="#top">Astro<span>Windy</span><b>.</b></a>

      <nav class="navlinks">
        <a href="#overview">Overview</a>
        <a href="#benefits">What you get</a>
        <a href="#process">Process</a>
        <a href="#packages">Packages</a>
        <a href="#proof">Proof</a>
      </nav>

      <a class="navcta" href="#contact">Start a project</a>
      <span class="mobile-menu">Menu</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="top">

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="eyebrow">SEO Article Writing</div>

        <h1>
          Content that earns attention — and keeps earning traffic.
        </h1>

        <p>
          Strategic, search-friendly articles written around real audiences,
          meaningful topics and the intent behind every query.
        </p>

        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn primary" href="#packages">Explore packages</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="#benefits">See what's included</a>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-note">
          Original writing · Human-edited · Search-informed · Built around your brand
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="overview">
      <div class="container intro">
        <div>
          <div class="kicker">The point isn't more content</div>
          <h2>It's better content, made to do a job.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="intro-copy">
          <p>
            Publishing another generic article is easy. Creating a useful piece
            of content that answers a real question, reflects your expertise and
            gives search engines something worth ranking is considerably harder.
          </p>

          <p>
            <strong>That's where we come in.</strong>
            AstroWindy combines editorial writing with practical SEO thinking
            so every article has a reason to exist.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section band" id="benefits">
      <div class="container">

        <div class="feature-head">
          <div>
            <div class="kicker">What you get</div>
            <h2 class="section-title">
              Six things we refuse to compromise on.
            </h2>
          </div>

          <p>
            No filler. No spun paragraphs. No keyword stuffing disguised as
            strategy. Just useful, original content built around your audience
            and objectives.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="features">

          <article class="feature">
            <div class="num">01 / Focus</div>
            <h3>Written around search intent.</h3>
            <p>
              We start with the question behind the query, then build the article
              around the information a reader actually came for.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature">
            <div class="num">02 / Originality</div>
            <h3>100% original thinking.</h3>
            <p>
              Every article is written from scratch and shaped to your subject,
              audience and brand voice.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature">
            <div class="num">03 / Quality</div>
            <h3>Proofread to perfection.</h3>
            <p>
              Clear structure, clean language and a final editorial pass before
              anything reaches you.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature">
            <div class="num">04 / Conversion</div>
            <h3>Useful enough to act on.</h3>
            <p>
              We don't write merely to hit a word count. We write to educate,
              reassure and move the reader forward.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature">
            <div class="num">05 / Flexibility</div>
            <h3>Built around your workflow.</h3>
            <p>
              One article, a monthly batch or an ongoing content engine —
              choose the level of support that fits.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature">
            <div class="num">06 / Confidence</div>
            <h3>A simpler publishing process.</h3>
            <p>
              Brief, research, writing and refinement are handled in one clear
              workflow, so your team spends less time chasing drafts.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature">
            <div class="num">07 / Partnership</div>
            <h3>Not just another content vendor.</h3>
            <p>
              We learn your priorities and keep improving the system as we learn
              what works for your audience.
            </p>
          </article>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="process">
      <div class="container process">

        <div>
          <div class="kicker">How it works</div>
          <h2 class="section-title">
            A calm process for a complicated job.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="process-list">

          <div class="step">
            <span>01</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Brief & understand</h3>
              <p>
                We establish the topic, audience, intent, tone and outcome
                before a word is written.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="step">
            <span>02</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Research & structure</h3>
              <p>
                We identify the useful angles, supporting questions and
                structure that give the article substance.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="step">
            <span>03</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Write & refine</h3>
              <p>
                The first draft is written for humans first, then refined for
                clarity, SEO and your brand voice.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="step">
            <span>04</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Review & deliver</h3>
              <p>
                You receive a clean, publication-ready article with room for
                feedback where needed.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section pricing" id="packages">
      <div class="container">

        <div class="pricing-intro">
          <div>
            <div class="kicker">Packages</div>
            <h2 class="section-title">
              Choose the level of content support you need.
            </h2>
          </div>

          <p>
            Simple packages for getting started, building momentum or handing
            your ongoing article production to a dedicated content partner.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="packages">

          <article class="package">
            <div class="tag">For testing the waters</div>
            <h3>Starter</h3>

            <p class="desc">
              A focused batch for brands that want to establish a consistent
              publishing rhythm.
            </p>

            <div class="price">₹—</div>

            <ul>
              <li>4 SEO articles</li>
              <li>1,000–1,500 words each</li>
              <li>Topic & intent research</li>
              <li>Editorial review</li>
            </ul>

            <a class="btn" href="#contact">Choose Starter</a>
          </article>

          <article class="package featured">
            <div class="tag">Most popular</div>
            <h3>Growth</h3>

            <p class="desc">
              A practical monthly content engine for businesses serious about
              organic growth.
            </p>

            <div class="price">₹—</div>

            <ul>
              <li>8 SEO articles</li>
              <li>1,500–2,000 words each</li>
              <li>Content planning support</li>
              <li>Priority turnaround</li>
            </ul>

            <a class="btn" href="#contact">Choose Growth</a>
          </article>

          <article class="package">
            <div class="tag">For serious scale</div>
            <h3>Authority</h3>

            <p class="desc">
              A larger editorial programme for brands building topical
              authority over time.
            </p>

            <div class="price">₹—</div>

            <ul>
              <li>12+ SEO articles</li>
              <li>Custom word counts</li>
              <li>Editorial direction</li>
              <li>Dedicated workflow</li>
            </ul>

            <a class="btn" href="#contact">Talk to us</a>
          </article>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="proof">
      <div class="container proof">

        <div>
          <div class="kicker">The human part</div>

          <p class="quote">
            “The best SEO content doesn't feel like SEO content.
            It simply feels like the right answer.”

            <small>
              That is the standard we're designing the service around.
            </small>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="proofcards">

          <article class="testimonial">
            <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p>
              “A much easier content process from brief to final draft.
              The writing finally sounds like us.”
            </p>
            <div class="person">Marketing lead · B2B services</div>
          </article>

          <article class="testimonial">
            <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p>
              “The difference was in the structure. The articles weren't just
              longer — they were more useful.”
            </p>
            <div class="person">Founder · Professional services</div>
          </article>

          <article class="testimonial">
            <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p>
              “Consistent quality and far less editing work for our internal team.”
            </p>
            <div class="person">Content manager · Growing brand</div>
          </article>

          <article class="testimonial">
            <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p>
              “It feels like having an editorial partner rather than outsourcing
              a word count.”
            </p>
            <div class="person">Growth lead · SaaS</div>
          </article>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" id="contact">
      <div class="container cta-inner">

        <div>
          <div class="kicker">Ready when you are</div>
          <h2>Let's make your next article worth finding.</h2>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p>
            Tell us what you're trying to rank for, who you're trying to reach
            and what success looks like. We'll take it from there.
          </p>

          <a class="btn" href="mailto:hello@astrowindy.com">
            Start a conversation →
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container foot">
      <span>© AstroWindy</span>
      <span>SEO content · strategy · editorial</span>
    </div>
  </footer>

</Layout>

<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap');

  :root {
    --ink: #16202a;
    --muted: #64717d;
    --line: #dfe5e8;
    --paper: #fbfaf7;
    --soft: #f1f4f2;
    --accent: #1f5f55;
    --accent2: #dcebe5;
    --max: 1180px;
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: var(--max);
    margin: auto;
    padding: 0 28px;
  }

  .topbar {
    font-size: 13px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
    color: #fff;
    background: #16202a;
  }

  .topbar .container {
    height: 38px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .topbar span:last-child {
    opacity: .72;
  }

  header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 20;
    background: rgba(251,250,247,.94);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(22,32,42,.08);
  }

  .nav {
    height: 76px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .brand {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk';
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
    font-size: 22px;
  }

  .brand b {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .navlinks {
    display: flex;
    gap: 30px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #46515a;
  }

  .navlinks a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .navcta {
    padding: 11px 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 690px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    color: #fff;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #1b2a2e;
  }

  .hero:before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        rgba(9,18,22,.88) 0%,
        rgba(9,18,22,.62) 48%,
        rgba(9,18,22,.18) 100%
      ),
      url('/hero.avif') center/cover;
  }

  .hero .container {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-top: 110px;
    padding-bottom: 78px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .16em;
    font-weight: 700;
    opacity: .78;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk';
    font-size: clamp(54px,7vw,92px);
    line-height: .96;
    letter-spacing: -.055em;
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
  }

  .hero p {
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 650px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.86);
    margin: 0 0 34px;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 14px 21px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .btn.primary {
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .btn.ghost {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .hero-note {
    margin-top: 46px;
    font-size: 13px;
    opacity: .68;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 105px 0;
  }

  .intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.35fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .kicker {
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .14em;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .intro h2,
  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk';
    font-size: clamp(38px,4.5vw,60px);
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -.045em;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
  }

  .intro-copy {
    font-size: 21px;
    color: #43505a;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .intro-copy p {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .intro-copy strong {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .band {
    background: var(--soft);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .feature-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 52px;
  }

  .feature-head p {
    max-width: 430px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(12,1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--line);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .feature {
    background: var(--paper);
    padding: 34px;
    min-height: 245px;
  }

  .feature:nth-child(1) {
    grid-column: span 7;
  }

  .feature:nth-child(2) {
    grid-column: span 5;
  }

  .feature:nth-child(3),
  .feature:nth-child(4),
  .feature:nth-child(5) {
    grid-column: span 4;
  }

  .feature:nth-child(6),
  .feature:nth-child(7) {
    grid-column: span 6;
  }

  .num {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk';
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .feature h3 {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk';
    font-size: 25px;
    letter-spacing: -.03em;
    margin: 45px 0 10px;
  }

  .feature p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .process {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
    gap: 80px;
  }

  .process-list {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 70px 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 28px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .step span {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .step h3 {
    margin: 0 0 5px;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk';
    font-size: 23px;
  }

  .step p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .pricing {
    background: #17242b;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .pricing .kicker {
    color: #9cc9bd;
  }

  .pricing .section-title {
    color: #fff;
  }

  .pricing-intro {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .pricing-intro p {
    max-width: 440px;
    color: #aab7bd;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .packages {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr);
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .package {
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 34px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    min-height: 390px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .package.featured {
    background: #dcebe5;
  }

  .package .tag {
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .13em;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .package h3 {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk';
    font-size: 30px;
    margin: 14px 0 6px;
  }

  .package .desc {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    min-height: 65px;
  }

  .price {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk';
    font-size: 44px;
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
    margin: 15px 0;
  }

  .package ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    color: #45515a;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .package li:before {
    content: '✓';
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }

  .package .btn {
    margin-top: auto;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .proof {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 90px;
  }

  .quote {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk';
    font-size: clamp(30px,3.5vw,48px);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .quote small {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'DM Sans';
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .proofcards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr);
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .testimonial {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 27px;
    background: #fff;
  }

  .stars {
    letter-spacing: .14em;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .testimonial p {
    font-size: 17px;
    margin: 20px 0 26px;
  }

  .person {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .cta {
    padding: 95px 0 110px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .cta-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 60px;
  }

  .cta h2 {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk';
    font-size: clamp(42px,5vw,68px);
    line-height: .98;
    letter-spacing: -.05em;
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .cta p {
    max-width: 440px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
  }

  .cta .btn {
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  footer {
    padding: 38px 0;
    background: #111a1f;
    color: #aab4b9;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .foot {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .mobile-menu {
    display: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .navlinks {
      display: none;
    }

    .mobile-menu {
      display: block;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 620px;
    }

    .intro,
    .process,
    .proof {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .feature-head,
    .pricing-intro,
    .cta-inner {
      display: block;
    }

    .feature-head p,
    .pricing-intro p,
    .cta p {
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .feature,
    .feature:nth-child(n) {
      grid-column: auto;
    }

    .packages,
    .proofcards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 78px 0;
    }

    .nav {
      height: 68px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 52px;
    }
  }
</style>
```

**One important point:** the prototype expects `hero.avif`. Put that image at `public/hero.avif`; otherwise the layout will be right, but the hero will not visually match.
